Package: wwand
Version: 2026.07.25~d6fc420e-r5
Depends: libc, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-struct, ucode-mod-uloop, ucode-mod-ubus, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-rtnl, ucode-mod-wwand-io
